  "evidenceBoundary": "The production MatchServer, BattleClient, shared NetworkBotDriver brain, prediction, reconciliation, snapshot and input codecs run for 32 clients through a deterministic per-link application-payload serializer with latency, jitter, loss, reordering, backpressure and speed caps. Session/control/fallback-input streams are ordered, while independent reliable snapshot streams may reorder; the focused harness test forces that case even if these three profiles do not. Correction headlines measure only the active-input workload; forced final convergence has separate buckets. Same-tick prediction-error buckets exclude cross-tick visual deltas and are reported separately from local presentation correction. Demand fields count payload admitted during the exact workload window; serialization may finish or be cancelled after that window, so they are not delivered throughput or observed link utilization. This is not a QUIC packet capture and excludes HTTP/3, TLS, UDP, IP, link-layer and congestion-control overhead.",
